  "description": "Daily Opportunity Follow-Up \u2014 runs every 24h (anchored at 12pm ET). Sends friendly follow-up emails to opportunities that received our initial response but haven't replied after 3 days. Max 2 follow-ups per opportunity, then closes them out.",
